.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.restic.example

# data/ is app config state (untracked, never commit). `data/*` auto-covers any
# new runtime subdir; only the traefik config-as-code files are tracked. Note
# traefik.yml is RENDERED from traefik.template.yml by `just dirs`, so the
# template is tracked and the output is not (it contains ACME_EMAIL).
data/*
!data/traefik/
data/traefik/*
!data/traefik/traefik.template.yml
!data/traefik/dynamic.yml
!data/traefik/crowdsec-acquis.yaml
